a picture with?

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm going to.
Go ahead.

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:39.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:44.477
